OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGet set, ready, go! Great North
OL,4,ARun gets under way
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 13.1-mile (21km) event sees runners
OL,7,Fand wheelchair users race through
OL,8,FGateshead and South Tyneside before
OL,9,Ffinishing in South Shields, with
OL,10,Fhundreds of thousands of people
OL,11,Fexpected to line the route.
OL,13,FThe elite men's, women's and wheelchair
OL,14,Fathlete races will set off first from
OL,15,Fabout 10:25 BST, before the masses take
OL,16,Fto the same streets.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
